%% title: When a new phone or email takes effect
%% desc: When you change it yourself, a code or link goes to the new address, and it takes effect once you confirm. In an account shared across several schools, if a school wants to change it, a link goes to the old address; it takes effect when you approve and enter the code sent to the new address. Until then the old one stays.
flowchart LR
  Y["You change it yourself<br/>(with your password)"] --> N["Code or link<br/>to the new address"]
  S["School wants to change it<br/>(multi-school account)"] --> O["Link to the old address<br/>opening it changes nothing"]
  O --> A{"Did you<br/>approve?"}
  A -- "No" --> K["Nothing changes"]
  A -- "Yes" --> N
  N --> D["The new one takes effect<br/>verified"]:::done
  classDef done fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
